//                hearWord   hear the word, tap how it's spelled (vowel swaps)
//                chunk      fill in the missing sound chunk (chunks + items)
//                sight      hear a sight word, tap it (words)
//                syll       how many syllables (words split with -)
//                qa         hand-written questions, one per line:
//                           prompt | right answer | wrong | wrong [| wrong]
