//                           a part starting with ^ is shown big (a picture or a word)
//                           a part starting with ? is the tip shown after a wrong answer
//   stories -- { t: title, p: passage, q: qa lines about it }
//   order   -- sentences for Build-a-Sentence and Word Train (one per line, a trailing emoji is a hint)
//   sets    -- Firefly Catch rules: RULE | words that fit | words that don't
